CM 868 MHz Rubber Duck - 2-Wire Realistic
CE
# Wire 1: The Antenna (5cm)
GW 1 15 0 0 0.001 0 0 0.051 0.00075
# Wire 2: The Counterpoise (10cm)
GW 2 15 0 0 0 0 0 -0.10 0.001
GE 0
# LD: Internal matching coil
LD 0 1 1 1 0 3.8E-7 0
# EX: Feed Point
EX 0 1 1 0 1 0
# FR: Frequency Sweep
FR 0 100 0 0 800 1
# RP: Starting at 0.5 degrees instead of 0 to avoid calculation errors
RP 0 180 73 1000 0.5 0 1 5
EN 
